Subject: [PATCH 1873/3799] soh: rename func_809CFF98 -> EnBw_FlipBack

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: rolls the slug back upright, fading its colour to normal, and returns it to the landing action once it touches down.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Bw/z_en_bw.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Bw/z_en_bw.c | 9 +++++----
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Bw/z_en_bw.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Bw/z_en_bw.c
